# Only each project's pyproject.toml and src/ are copied into the images. Everything else stays
# out of the build context, which matters most for data/: config.yaml holds PASSKEYs,
# dashboard.yaml a database token, and secret.key signs the admin forms, and the context is
# sent to the Docker daemon in full.
*
!core/pyproject.toml
!core/src/
!collector/pyproject.toml
!collector/src/
!dashboard/api/pyproject.toml
!dashboard/api/src/
**/__pycache__
